<div class="calculator page-content page-width page-width--narrow section-template--17099647352990__main-padding int-title-head">
  <div class="bra-size-calculator">
    <div class="row size-measurement">
      <div class="col-lg-7 col-md-7 col-sm-12 collection_clm">
        <div class="light-img overflow-hidden shadow">
          <img
            src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0652/5383/4910/files/bra-size-quiz-img.jpg?v=1715848223"
            alt="Left Image"
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-5 col-md-5 col-sm-12 background-white-border">
        <div class="text-bind-content">
          <img
            src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0652/5383/4910/files/bra-size-quiz-icon.png?v=1716195845"
            width="100%"
            alt="Logo Image"
          >
          <h1 class="text-uppercase">not sure about your size?</h1>
          <h2 class="text-uppercase">take the bra size quiz</h2>
          <div class="cta__content-4 text-anim text-center mt-15">
            <!--
              <a rel="noreferrer" href="" target="_blank" class="nionx-btn nionx-btn--base dyn-btn-three"><span>Shop MORE</span></a>
            -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3>
      Achieving the perfect fit is essential for your comfort and confidence. Our easy-to-use calculator will help you
      find your ideal bra size in just a few simple steps.
    </h3><h5>How It Works:</h5>
    <ul>
      
      <li>
        <p><span>Measure Your Underbust:</span> Using a soft measuring tape, measure around your ribcage, directly under your bust. Make sure the tape is snug
        but not tight.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p><span>Measure Your Overbust:</span> Measure around the fullest part of your bust, keeping the tape parallel to the ground.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><span> Calculate Your Size:</span>  Click the "Calculate" button to find your perfect bra size. The calculator will determine your band size and cup
        size based on your measurements, giving you the ideal fit. Once you have your perfect bra size, browse our wide range of stylish and comfortable bras designed to fit every
        body type.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="bra-size">
      <form id="bra-size-form">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 underbust-bef" style="position:relative;">
            <label for="underbust">Underbust measurement (in inches)</label>
            <input type="number" id="underbust" name="underbust" min="20" max="50" step="0.5" required>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 overbust-bef" style="position:relative;">
            <label for="overbust">Overbust measurement (in inches)</label>
            <input type="number" id="overbust" name="overbust" min="25" max="60" step="0.5" required>
          </div>
          <div class="bra-size-btn mt-20">
            <button class="nionx-btn nionx-btn--base" type="submit">Calculate</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
      <div id="bra-size-result"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
